From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:00:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 008/202] dt-bindings: phy: mediatek,xsphy: Add MT6858

The MT6858 USB 2.0 port uses an XS-PHY at 0x11e10000 with a single U2
port and no shared U3 bank. Add its compatible.

Signed-off-by: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/mediatek,xsphy.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/mediatek,xsphy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/mediatek,xsphy.yaml
index c00115edf..fdbe04a52 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/mediatek,xsphy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/mediatek,xsphy.yaml
@@ -49,6 +49,7 @@ properties:
       - enum:
           - mediatek,mt3611-xsphy
           - mediatek,mt3612-xsphy
+          - mediatek,mt6858-xsphy
           - mediatek,mt7988-xsphy
       - const: mediatek,xsphy
 
